n><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">/5.0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-rose-100 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[100px]\">\n            <span class=\"block text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold mb-1\">シチュエーション密度</span>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-black text-rose-500\">4.8</span><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">/5.0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-rose-100 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[100px]\">\n            <span class=\"block text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold mb-1\">生々しさ・カメラワーク</span>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-black text-rose-500\">4.4</span><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">/5.0</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block bg-rose-500 text-white text-[9px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-1\">読者レビュー</span>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed\">「試しに見るつもりが、完全に予想を超えてきて即リピート確定でした。」</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block bg-rose-500 text-white text-[9px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-1\">読者レビュー</span>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed\">「タイトルに偽りなし。生々しいリアル・素人衝動好きなら絶対に後悔しない当たり作品。」</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
